From e12cffc24e736b60f488103342c63fa1cae39813 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 01:27:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: authorize the return path and remove the unlock
 swipe and delay

Squash of former patches:

- 0071 test: add coverage for the return-direction switch authorization
- 0072 sovereignos: mirror the decoy switch authorization for the return path
- 0073 test: expect the redeemed active-dismiss grant to land without a swipe
- 0074 sovereignos: redeem the active-dismiss grant proactively instead of on a gesture
- 0075 test: expect the authorized-branch dismiss with no artificial delay
- 0076 sovereignos: drop the artificial delay before redeeming the active-dismiss grant
- 0077 test: expect the return-path credential check to unlock CE storage
- 0078 sovereignos: unlock the returning user on a matched return credential
- 0079 test: expect the authorized-switch dismiss to suppress the unlock animation
- 0080 sovereignos: cut rather than animate the authorized-switch dismissal
- 0081 test: expect the authorized-switch dismiss mark to be single-use
- 0082 sovereignos: suppress the canned unlock animation for an authorized switch
- 0083 test: expect an authorized switch to keep its bouncer up
- 0084 sovereignos: keep the bouncer up across an authorized switch
